  "idea": "Baserow: the completely free open-source Airtable alternative",
  "text": "You can build custom client trackers and CRM systems without paying monthly SaaS fees. Service agencies often juggle client deliverables across disparate spreadsheets that constantly fall out of sync. Commercial CRMs charge hefty monthly minimums while lacking the customizable relational views your team requires. Baserow lets you link customer records, track milestones, and generate intake forms on self-hosted infrastructure. You streamline client operations without recurring software overhead.",
